@startuml
title Export Template - /api/v1/assessment/export-template GET (AllowAnonymous)

start

:Controller receives ExportTemplate request;

note right
Access: AllowAnonymous
end note

:Send ExportTemplateQuery to MediatR;

:ExportTemplateHandler executes;

:Locate preloaded template file;

if (File exist?) then (Yes)

    :Read file content;

    :Return 200 OK - Excel template file;

else (No)

    :Return 404 Not Found - Template file not found;
    stop

endif

stop

@enduml
